&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer - Industrial Automation, Semiconductor &amp;amp; Scientific Instrumentation (Talent Pool) - all grades&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Healthcare (AXA) | 3x Salary Life Assurance | Annual Bonus | EMI Share Scheme | Hybrid Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay ranges:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;£32,000 –&amp;nbsp; £50,000&amp;nbsp; (Junior roles)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;£50,000 – £70,000 (Senior roles)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salaries are variable. We will always advise you of the role and pay range which aligns to the role we are considering you for if you are invited to attend an assessment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Abingdon, Oxfordshire&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Pattern:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid (typically 3 days per week onsite)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a Software Engineer who enjoys building software that controls real-world hardware rather than websites, mobile apps or business systems?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you have experience developing software for industrial automation, scientific instrumentation, semiconductor equipment, robotics, machine control, motion systems or other complex engineering products?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;Infinitesima&lt;/strong&gt;, software engineering sits at the heart of everything we do. Our engineers develop the applications, control systems and operator interfaces that power sophisticated Atomic Force Microscopy (AFM) inspection and metrology systems used by leading semiconductor manufacturers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we prepare for significant growth over the next 6-12 months, we&#39;re building a network of talented Software Engineers across a range of experience levels, from early-career engineers through to Principal Engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from exceptional engineers who would like to be considered as future opportunities become available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Infinitesima?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Abingdon, Oxfordshire, Infinitesima develops advanced semiconductor metrology technology that is helping enable the next generation of electronics manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our technology combines cutting-edge software, precision mechanics, motion control and nanoscale measurement science to solve some of the most challenging problems in semiconductor inspection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a growing team of more than 150 scientists, engineers and business professionals, backed by world-class investors including Applied Ventures, the venture capital arm of Applied Materials, one of the global leaders in semiconductor equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to register your interest with a company where software engineering directly influences the performance of highly advanced scientific and industrial systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies and Skills We&#39;re Actively Interested In&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re particularly keen to connect with Software Engineers who bring one or more of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industrial C#/.NET development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desktop application development using WPF or similar frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with object-oriented programming languages such as C#, Java or C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software development for industrial automation, robotics or machine control systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tool control or hardware-integrated software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Precision motion control, mechatronics or real-time control systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scientific instrumentation, semiconductor equipment or metrology systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working alongside electronics, optics, hardware or mechanical engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional experience that would be advantageous includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C++ development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Messaging and communication technologies such as DDS, MQTT, RabbitMQ, ZeroMQ or Named Pipes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile software delivery and sprint-based development environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Future Software Engineering Opportunities Could Involve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role and level, future opportunities could include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and developing C#/.NET applications for semiconductor inspection and metrology systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing software that controls precision motion systems and nanoscale positioning technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building user interfaces and HMI applications using WPF and related technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrating software with motion controllers, piezo actuators, sensors and data acquisition hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting system integration, verification, validation and software releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to software architecture, engineering standards and best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating within multidisciplinary teams spanning software, electronics, optics and mechanical engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring and supporting less experienced engineers (senior-level roles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Interested In&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re particularly interested in hearing from engineers who have experience in one or more of the following environments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industrial automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion control systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Robotics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scientific instrumentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Semiconductor equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Metrology systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Control systems engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-precision electromechanical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and development environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For early-career engineers, a strong academic background in computer science, software engineering, mathematics, physics or another scientific discipline is highly valuable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more experienced engineers, experience within scientific, engineering or hardware-focused industries would be particularly relevant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Talent Pool May Be a Good Fit If...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve developed software that interacts with hardware, instruments or machinery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve worked in engineering environments rather than purely commercial software settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy solving complex technical challenges involving software, electronics and mechanical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re excited by the idea of contributing to advanced semiconductor technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Talent Pool Is Less Likely to Be Suitable If...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your experience is primarily focused on web development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your background is predominantly SaaS, fintech or e-commerce platforms&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;You have limited exposure to hardware-integrated software or engineering products&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re interested in candidates who have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Physics or a related discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equivalent commercial experience developing complex engineering software systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Our Talent Community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re interested in future Software Engineering opportunities at Infinitesima, we&#39;d encourage you to apply and introduce yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Future positions are expected to span multiple levels, from Software Engineer through to Principal Engineer, with compensation and responsibilities aligned to experience, capability and scope of role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining our Software Engineer Talent Pool, you&#39;ll be among the first professionals we consider when suitable opportunities become available. Whilst applying does not guarantee an interview or future position, it allows us to contact you directly when a role aligns with your skills and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional engineering needs exceptional engineers. If you&#39;re ready for your next challenge, we&#39;d love to stay connected.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Infinitesima is a privately owned company founded in 2001 as a spin-out from the University of Bristol by CTO Professor Andrew Humphris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our scientists and engineers are dedicated to enabling the next generation of semiconductor devices through the development of innovative metrology solutions used by customers around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that diversity of thought, background and experience drives innovation. We are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can contribute, develop and succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require adjustments at any stage of the recruitment process, please let us know and we&#39;ll do our best to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Recruitment Journey&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview availability:&lt;/strong&gt; Monday to Friday, 9:00am to 4:30pm UK time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;45-minute remote interview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An opportunity to discuss your experience, technical background and career interests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onsite interview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A collaborative assessment of technical capability, communication style, problem-solving approach and ways of working. You&#39;ll also have the opportunity to learn more about our technology, culture and future plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re committed to creating a comfortable interview experience. If eye contact feels challenging, please let us know. For remote interviews, you&#39;re welcome to switch your camera off after introductions if that helps you feel more at ease.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We dress casually and informal attire is absolutely fine for onsite interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;N.B. Depending on operational requirements, we may invite you to a group assessment where several vacancies are available. In this instance, full details of how the day will be for you, salary and job description will be shared when you are invited.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on How We Use AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use AI solely to transcribe interviews so that interviewers can focus on the conversation rather than taking detailed notes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is not used to assess candidates or make hiring decisions. All recruitment decisions are made by people based on the conversations and evidence gathered throughout the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location and Working Pattern&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognise the value of flexibility and offer hybrid working wherever possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most employees typically work onsite three days per week, although some positions may require additional onsite presence due to the nature of the work and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recruitment agencies: Infinitesima only works with approved recruitment partners and does not accept unsolicited CVs. Please do not submit candidate details in response to this advertisement. Infinitesima is not responsible for any fees relating to unsolicited applications or CV submissions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Technical Support Engineer - Semiconductor Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Semiconductor Equipment | Motion Control | Advanced Automation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;£60,000 - £75,000 + Bonus + Private Healthcare&amp;nbsp; BUPA + Share Options&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Abingdon, Oxfordshire (Hybrid)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Solve the problems nobody else can.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Infinitesima is developing breakthrough semiconductor metrology technology that enables the world&#39;s leading chip manufacturers to measure devices at previously impossible levels of precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our technology scales globally, we&#39;re looking for a Senior Systems Engineer who thrives on solving complex technical challenges spanning software, automation, motion control, electronics and high-precision instrumentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for engineers who enjoy getting to the root cause of difficult problems, understanding how complete systems interact and becoming the person others turn to when the answer isn&#39;t obvious.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re currently working within semiconductor equipment, robotics, scientific instrumentation, advanced manufacturing or precision engineering, this could be the challenge you&#39;ve been looking for.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why engineers join us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work on technology that combines:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nanometre-scale motion control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Precision positioning systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Semiconductor automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Robotics and wafer handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software-driven instrumentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced control systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-performance electromechanical assemblies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, you&#39;ll have direct influence over how future generations of our products are designed, improved and deployed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a role where you&#39;ll simply report problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll help solve them permanently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Own the toughest technical challenges&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead investigations into complex system-level issues across customer and manufacturing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose problems spanning software, firmware, automation, controls, electronics and mechanical subsystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive rapid resolution of high-priority technical escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior technical authority supporting Customer Success, Applications and Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Become a system expert&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse motion control performance and closed-loop control behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate sensor feedback, positioning accuracy and automation performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify failure modes across interconnected hardware and software systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support optimisation of high-precision semiconductor equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Shape the next generation of products&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct structured root cause investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring issues and long-term corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed technical findings directly into Product Development and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence reliability, serviceability and future product design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Raise technical capability across the business&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop troubleshooting tools and diagnostic procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create technical knowledge resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support training and coaching activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build deeper system understanding across multiple disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We&#39;re keen to hear from engineers with experience in:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Semiconductor equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Semiconductor metrology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Robotics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scientific instrumentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microscopy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Photonics and optics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Precision engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced manufacturing equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex electromechanical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Essential&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience troubleshooting complex technical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and root cause investigation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of motion control, automation or precision positioning technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across software, mechanical, electrical and systems domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence communicating technical issues to a range of audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Desirable&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Semiconductor industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Semiconductor equipment or metrology systems knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation or robotics integration experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to microscopy or scientific instrumentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python, LabVIEW or C#.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why this opportunity is different&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a growing technology company backed by leading semiconductor investors, including Applied Ventures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside experts in precision engineering, semiconductor metrology, software and instrumentation while helping solve some of the industry&#39;s most challenging measurement problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a rare opportunity to move beyond component-level engineering and become a true systems expert within one of the UK&#39;s most exciting semiconductor scale-ups.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A bit about us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Infinitesima is a privately owned company founded in 2001, as a spin-out of the University of Bristol, by CTO Professor Andrew Humphris. Our dynamic team of scientists and engineers is focussed on enabling the next generation of semiconductor devices through delivery of innovative products to customers around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our strength lies in the varied perspectives that come from different cultures, experiences, and identities. We believe that true innovation is fuelled by collaboration, locally and globally. We strive to foster an environment where everyone can contribute meaningfully and thrive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;If you require adjustments to take part in the recruitment process, please let us know, we’ll do our best to support you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your recruitment journey:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We will interview you: Monday to Friday UK Time 9am to 4.30pm and we&#39;ll be as flexible as we can with Global Scheduling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1st stage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(45 minute) Remote meeting to evaluate your experience and technical ability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2nd stage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(2.5 hours) Face to face onsite evaluating technical, presentation and communication skills along with your ways of working and your opportunity to to know more about us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re not comfortable with eye contact, let us know at the start of your interview and if REMOTE, once we&#39;ve said hello, feel free to turn your camera off until the end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Informal dress is absolutely fine for onsite interviews, we want you to feel comfortable when you meet us and if there&#39;s anything else we can do to support your journey, just let us know.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note on how we use AI:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We use AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to transcribe our interviews so we can focus fully on you instead of scribbling notes. The AI does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;take part in any decision making at any stage. All hiring decisions are made by real humans based on the conversation we have with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location and working pattern:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We recognise the value of flexibility and offer a hybrid working model wherever possible. Most employees work onsite three days per week, although some positions require a greater onsite presence due to the nature of the work and business need&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recruitment agencies: Infinitesima Ltd only works with approved agencies and does not accept unsolicited agency CVs. Please do not submit candidate details in response to this advert or solicit any Infinitesima Ltd employees. Infinitesima Ltd is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited CVs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
