&lt;li&gt;Optical, photonics or precision measurement systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automated testing and continuous integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified LabVIEW Developer (CLD) or Certified LabVIEW Architect (CLA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
