&lt;li&gt;Experience building, integrating, and testing complex, high-value technology products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in cleanroom manufacturing and controlled environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical approach to troubleshooting and root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience transitioning products from development into production.&lt;/li&gt;
