&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnerships Managers&lt;/strong&gt; play a pivotal, partner‑facing role. You will also manage and expand top‑tier partnerships (financial technology firms, e‑commerce platforms, point‑of‑sale solutions) and drive business opportunities in a fast‑moving environment. Acting as the central point of contact, you will influence internal and external stakeholders, expand Alma’s reach, and create value for Alma, our partners, and our merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Strategic Partnerships Manager Lead, you will work closely with the Sales team, the Onboarding team, the Retail Training team and the Merchant Support team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
